;;;; tokyo-night.theme: rhizome colour theme, format 1
;;;;
;;;; Origin: rhizome's default colours. The bar, prompt, message,
;;;;   border, and recording colours come from the Tokyo Night palette;
;;;;   the launcher and menu purples, the unfocused border, and the
;;;;   shadow base are rhizome's own.
;;;; Authors: Tokyo Night palette by Enkia (tokyo-night-vscode-theme),
;;;;   also carried by folke's tokyonight.nvim (Apache-2.0); rhizome's
;;;;   colours by Glenn Thompson.
